  "stageId": "act12d0_06",
  "title": "Encounter",
  "storyCode": "RI-6",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "72503e7be606e57275709387036838723a7375b16e99057937fd0112119c4837",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Where are the others?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clan Leader A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "The people of the Great Wood Tribe are gone. I heard that leader was defeated by an outsider."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Peta",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "The Firestone and Thick Tail Tribes were defeated by an stranger carrying a pile of weapons on her back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clan Leader A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Some of the tribes decided to join up with Zumama."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clan Leader B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "The truth is Zumama's managed to drum up a formidable front. If I weren't with Gavial, I might have gone to Zumama myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Doesn't matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Your tribes will be enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clan Leader B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hey, can we really challenge Zumama on our own?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gavial can definitely beat Zumama's giant machine. Then, I will become the Great Chief and force Gavial to stay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Peta",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Peta thinks that is not a good idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But this is the only way to make her stay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Don't forget why we formed 'Gavial's Will'!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "'Gavial's Will' is not just a tribe. It is an alliance dedicated to the vision of Gavial as the Great Chief!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clan Leader B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I agree with Tomimi. I'll only recognize Gavial as the Great Chief."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clan Leader A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "That's right, Gavial should be the one to lead us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Clan Leader C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hah, if I disagreed I wouldn't be here either!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Peta",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "...Peta doesn't like it, but Peta will follow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Alright, you head over to Zumama's tribe and wait outside for me, got it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Other Clan Leaders",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Right. This is all for Gavial."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Other Clan Leaders",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "All for Gavial!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Doctor! Everyone! Great, I finally found you guys!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "*Sigh*, Doctor, you had me worried."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "Huh? Blaze, why are you wearing your swimsuit... and carrying some kid on your back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "I ran into this little girl on my way over here. She started hitting me for some reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "I kicked her ass, of course, and beat down all her friends too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Gotta hand it to her, she's not bad in a fight, didn't go down easy. So I brought her along. I figured you could help me ask why she wanted to fight me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "It's Kemar. She probably just thought you looked strong. She just loves fighting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Hah. That means something, coming from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "I don't love fighting. I'm just a hands-on problem solver."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Whatever."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flint",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "...Where... am I...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "Morning, Kemar."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flint",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "Gavial?! What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "You bumped into my friend, fought her, and lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Heh, welcome back, kid."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flint",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Hey, Gavial. What's she doing? What's with this bowing?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "Kemar, what gives?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flint",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "I felt a greater strength from her than anything I ever felt from Zumama."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flint",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "I'm not interested in you anymore, Gavial. Looks like you can talk to her, so please, ask her to teach me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "Oh, she wants you to teach her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "I guess she thinks you're strong, so she wants to become your disciple or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "...Doctor, what do I do?! I've never been in a situation like this before!"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "It's up to you.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Nothing to do with me.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Ugh, how about we just let her follow us for now?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Sure. Hey, Kemar, come with us."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Flint",
          "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
          "text": "Okay."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Flint",
          "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
          "text": "But call me Flint."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Come to think of it, what happened to the ceremony?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Doctor, why don't you explain it to Blaze?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "She'll let her people get Oripathy just to build her machines?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "I won't stand by and let that happen."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "What are we waiting for, Doctor? Let's go!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "Wait, we still got somewhere to be!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Huh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
